      "lore": "From detonating ammo stores to corrosive innards or frenzied death throes, some targets are deadly even in defeat.",
      "name": "Deadly Demise D3",
      "rules": "This ability always takes the form <b>Deadly Demise X</b>. Each time a model with this ability is <b>destroyed</b>, after the units embarked within it (if any) have made their <b>emergency disembark moves</b>, roll one D6. On a 6, that model suffers a <b>deadly demise</b>; each unit within 6\" of that model suffers a number of <b>mortal wounds</b> denoted by <b>X</b> (if this is a random number, roll separately for each unit within 6\").",
